    "narrative": "For today\u2019s slate on August 24, 2026, the Austin Waves look to capitalize on a high-upside matchup for **Sam Antonacci**, who leads our active squad with a 63.61 efficiency score. Leading off against Kumar Rocker, **Sam Antonacci** benefits from a massive 10% lift for his spot in the order and a favorable platoon advantage. Similarly, **Nasim Nunez** emerges as a high-value start (61.73) against Ryan Feltner. While his #8 spot in the lineup typically drags his value, his elite sprint speed remains our primary weapon in this category-starved 5x5 format, and he receives a substantial 19% boost due to Feltner\u2019s high 5.10 xERA, signaling a prime opportunity for **Nasim Nunez** to catalyze the bottom of the order.\n\n**Miguel Vargas** (55.00) and **Jackson Merrill** (51.66) provide stable production, though **Jackson Merrill** faces a tougher test against Braxton Ashcraft\u2019s 3.28 xERA; his score is buoyed heavily by a 13% platoon edge. **Liam Hicks** (47.26) remains our riskiest start, as his base projection is stifled by a dynamic platoon disadvantage against Framber Valdez. We are currently monitoring official lineup cards closely for **Liam Hicks**, **Miguel Vargas**, **Nasim Nunez**, **Sam Antonacci**, and **Jackson Merrill**; if any of these players move down in their respective batting orders, their scores will be subject to immediate downward revision. \n\nWith **Kyle Tucker**, **Gunnar Henderson**, **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.**, and **Luis Robert Jr.** all facing team off-days, our bench strategy today is effectively sidelined. Consequently, no complex \"start/sit\" decisions were required among our core stars. However, we remain prepared to rotate depth pieces like **Andy Pages**, **Jordan Westburg**, or **Heliot Ramos** should any late-breaking weather alerts or injury scratches impact the confirmed lineups for **Liam Hicks** or our other active hitters. We are effectively holding the line today, relying on the speed of **Nasim Nunez** and the table-setting abilities of **Sam Antonacci** to secure the steals necessary to maintain our competitive edge.",
